    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dogwash Perle and Co, in Mouans-Sartoux, in the Grasse-Cannes area, offers a self-service dog washing station. Dogs up to 80 kg are accepted there, which covers most sizes, including large breeds.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The products used are an aloe vera shampoo and a strawberry-scented conditioner. In addition to the self-service wash, classic grooming is also available by appointment. This information is cross-checked between the business's official website and the local directory mouanssartouxgo.fr, giving a medium-to-high confidence level. Prices, on the other hand, are not disclosed publicly — don't rely on a generic market estimate, it's better to call or check on site.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the 80 kg threshold covers a wide range, but if your dog is right at the upper limit, a call ahead to confirm the tub size avoids any bad surprises.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Mouans-Sartoux, between Grasse and Cannes, gives quick access both to the perfumeries of Grasse and to the Cannes coastline.</p>
